    "No divergence above the natural spread between valid code paths in 3 formats x 5 CPU classes x 2 engines (llama.cpp, prism), plus ik_llama.cpp on arm-dotprod. Greedy text identical everywhere.",
    "The same Q1_0 file gives PPL 23.1535-23.1794 (0.11%) depending on which code path the engine picks for the CPU; both paths are the same distance from the exact F16 reference. PPL alone cannot tell a correct path from a wrong one at this scale.",
